an save us but you can't  fight me this time i need full control  speaking about the body now steven  thinks he's going crazy he ignores his  moving reflection that is speaking to  him and he starts to slap himself and  then he says he's going to die now  eventually mark says look at me and  stephen does he tells him he's not going  to die let me save us and if you notice  there is no longer a reflection of  stephen in the mirrors and any of the  mirrors because it's kind of creating  like an infinite mirror here the  reflection is gone and it's just marked  that he sees in the mirror mark says let  me save us and steven finally gives in  and as steven starts to agree and mark  starts to take over you can see egyptian  markings and hieroglyphics in the  background kind of start to light up  steven shakes his head yes and all of a  sudden the reflection of mark is gone  it's back to the reflections of stephen  or now i should say mark and moon knight  comes out right as the moon knight  transformation begins the egyptian  jackal jumps in and attacks him however  the next thing that we see is the  egyptian jackal trying to get away  showing you just how strong moon knight  is and in this last scene we can see  moon knight does not hold his punches  and marvel is going to show us him not  holding his punches and the episode ends  with our first full look at moon knight  not that we didn't see it in the trailer  but it's first revealed in this episode  so what did you think about the very  first episode of moon night i thought it  was a great episode and i'm super  excited to see how this all ends so let  me know what you think in the comments  down below about the first episode of  moon night don't forget to like the  video and subscribe so you don't miss  out on any future moon night videos for  live updates you can follow me on  instagram and twitter and as always  thank you all so much for watching woof
 

